@startuml

title US11 - Register Parameter\nSystem Sequence Diagram (SSD)

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #2563EB
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
skinparam ActorBorderColor #334155
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF9E6

actor "Administrator" as Admin
participant "UKLabsMS" as System

' =====================================================
' Main Success Scenario
' =====================================================

Admin -> System : Requests parameter registration

System --> Admin : Requests parameter information

Admin -> System : Provides code, name, description,\nmetric and metric classification

System --> Admin : Requests optional reference values

Admin -> System : Provides reference values,\nwhen applicable

alt Valid information and unique code

    System --> Admin : Confirms successful parameter registration

else Invalid code format

    System --> Admin : Informs that the code must contain\nexactly five alphanumeric characters

else Duplicate parameter code

    System --> Admin : Informs that the parameter code\nis already registered

else Reference values incompatible with metric type

    System --> Admin : Informs that reference values are\nonly allowed for numeric metrics

else Invalid reference interval

    System --> Admin : Informs that the minimum reference\nvalue cannot exceed the maximum

else Other invalid information

    System --> Admin : Informs that the registration\ncould not be completed

end

' =====================================================
' Acceptance Criteria
' =====================================================

note right of System
AC11-1:
The parameter code must
contain exactly five
alphanumeric characters
and must be unique.

AC11-2:
Reference values are only
applicable to numeric metrics.

Metric classification:
Numeric or Qualitative.
end note

@enduml